sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as App
  participant T as Terminal
  participant C as hack CLI
  A->>U: Explain step, show exact command
  U->>A: Open in Terminal
  A->>T: New window, command typed, waits for Enter
  U->>T: Enter
  T->>C: hack global trust
  C->>U: sudo asks for password (in Terminal)
  C-->>T: exit code
  A->>C: re-run the check (hack doctor --json)
  A->>U: Step done, failed, or skipped
